{"product":{"id":9728655655137,"title":"BILLY GOAT 118","body_html":"<p>The Billy Goat 118 is our dedicated resort powder ski: a 118mm directional platform built to float, smear, and charge through the deepest resort days for skiers who keep going after the snow gets tracked out.</p>\n<p>The Billy Goat 118 features the Reverse Elliptical Sidecut that defines the series: a large convex arc from boot center to the tip that lets the ski float and slash without hooking, paired with a traditional tail radius that locks in when you need to hold a line. Signature Pow Rocker helps the ski plane early and smear through deep snow, while low camber underfoot keeps the wide platform loose and maneuverable without giving up drive through chop. A directional mount and supportive tail give strong skiers a powder platform they can push. This is the Billy Goat for deep resort days, big terrain, and skiers who would rather drive a powder ski than simply ride it.</p>\n<p>Every Billy Goat 118 is built with our custom 2800 hybrid fiberglass/carbon composite, a 100% bamboo core, full-length UHMW sidewalls, and the thickest bases and edges in skiing. The result is a stable, powerful, and durable powder ski designed to take a beating.</p>","vendor":"ON3P","product_type":"Skis","created_at":"2026-09-15T20:17:50-07:00","handle":"billy-goat-118","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:41-07:00","published_at":"2026-09-20T14:31:01-07:00","template_suffix":"ski","published_scope":"global","tags":"26.27, Billy Goat, Stock Ski","variants":[{"id":49128491253985,"product_id":9728655655137,"title":"176cm","price":"949.00","sku":"27ON3PBG118176","position":1,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"176cm","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-09-15T20:17:50-07:00","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:41-07:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0,"weight_unit":"lb","inventory_quantity":6,"old_i